-## Dependency Injection Pattern (Updated S3_2)
-
-`create_app()` accepts optional `service` parameter:
-- **Production:** `create_app()` — creates `TaskService(task_storage)` with real storage
-- **Testing:** `create_app(service=MockTaskService())` — injects mock, no file I/O
